// DRAWING SETTINGS MODAL:
//   - Line section tools (TD[k].g === 'ln'): 4 tabs (Style / Text / Coordinates / Visibility)
//   - All Fib tools (/fib/i.test(TD[k].n)): 3 tabs ONLY (Style / Coordinates / Visibility)
//     with full 24-level TradingView Fib Retracement Style UI
